---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Contact" description="Get in touch with Bryan Courtney White, Python Software Engineer.">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Contact</h1>
    <p class="text-gray-400 text-lg mb-12 leading-relaxed">
      Building in public and sharing the journey. If you want to talk Python, data systems,
      AI, or just connect with someone who enjoys taking an idea from zero to deployed —
      reach out through any of the links below.
    </p>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-12">
      <a
        href="https://github.com/bryancourtneywhite"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 hover:border-emerald-400 rounded-xl p-6 flex items-center gap-4 transition-all group"
      >
        <div class="text-3xl">🐙</div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-white font-semibold group-hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">GitHub</p>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">@bryancourtneywhite</p>
        </div>
      </a>

      <a
        href="https://linkedin.com/in/bryancourtneywhite"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 hover:border-emerald-400 rounded-xl p-6 flex items-center gap-4 transition-all group"
      >
        <div class="text-3xl">💼</div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-white font-semibold group-hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">LinkedIn</p>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">bryancourtneywhite</p>
        </div>
      </a>

      <a
        href="mailto:bryancourtneywhite@gmail.com"
        class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 hover:border-emerald-400 rounded-xl p-6 flex items-center gap-4 transition-all group"
      >
        <div class="text-3xl">✉️</div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-white font-semibold group-hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">Email</p>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">bryancourtneywhite@gmail.com</p>
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-8">
      <h2 class="text-white font-semibold text-lg mb-2">What I'm about</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
        I'm on a deliberate path to becoming a software engineer, building in public and learning by doing.
        I'm drawn to the edges of what's possible — exploring new technology with curiosity, asking what it
        can do before asking what it should do. My focus is owning my own project pipeline end to end:
        from a rough idea, through proof of concept, all the way to something deployed and running in the real world.
        Every project here is a step in that direction.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
